      "text": "4-star hotels: 474 Buenos Aires (4 nights), Calafate Parque (2 nights), Wyndham Garden Ushuaia (2 nights), Mercure Iguazu (3 nights). 1 guest SGL — $7,568; 2 guests SGL — $5,651; 2 guests DBL — $4,036; 3 guests SGL — $5,265; 3 guests DBL — $3,650; 3 guests TRL — $3,578.",
